{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22337","headline":"早朝贺雪寄陈山人 · 白居易","name":"早朝贺雪寄陈山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安盈尺雪，早朝贺君喜。\n将赴银台门，始出新昌里。\n上堤马蹄滑，中路蜡烛死。\n十里向北行，寒风吹破耳。\n待漏午门外，候对三殿里。\n须鬓冻生冰，衣裳冷如水。\n忽思仙游谷，闇谢陈居士。\n暖覆褐裘眠，日高应未起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}